i18n/cn","击退靠近的敌人并造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","近くの敵を後退させ、ダメージを与える"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对距离2格以内的敌人释放，装填“震击弹”，造成220% + 25% ATK伤害，并将其击退2格。装填“碎裂弹”期间无法使用本技能。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","2マス内の敵に向けて発動。「振撃弾」を装填し、対象に220% + 25% ATKのダメージを与え、2マス後退させる。「分裂弾」を装填している間、このスキルは発動できない"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":26,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至230% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが230% + 25% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至240% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが240% + 25% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK